    "body": "Add the rebate regression from public Rust beta checking and Source/6 emission through both TypeScript consumers. The25 original candidate and independent expectation files are unchanged.\n\nValidation on integration36af18d4: offline source6-expansion build passed44.125s; complete Node regression passed0.207s. The test checks the complete expected AST, ordered effects and selected financial outcomes. Prefix frames remain conditional mathematical expectations; local PreparedUnqualified output is not proof or ledger acceptance.\n\nFresh whole current source/result review is pending. This draft is stacked after CLI guidance; historical reviews do not approve this new integration.\n\n\n### Current source and result review\n\nFresh review of exact head `36af18d48569c165480f104bed2b12b85e215d88` and its actual result is now qualified and adopted. The current build (44.125 seconds) and Node consumer (0.207 seconds) passed. All 25 original candidate/oracle bodies remain unchanged. Review qualifications preserve conditional DTO/codec correspondence, unobserved post-work fields and the two frozen EOF whitespace diagnostics; this establishes no proof or ledger acceptance.\n\nThe exact published stack still requires parent delivery and verified main-tree equality before merge. No wider EARS, native or target exit is closed by this PR.\n",
